// Axon Standard Library — Numerical Analysis, FFT, Quadrature, Root-Finding, ODEs & Optimization (`std/numeric.ax`)
// 100% Pure Axon, Zero-CRT `libm`, Perceus 0-GC, SRoA-friendly `Complex` & Reverse-Communication Solvers.

use std::linalg

